
TAX CENTRE EFILE HELP DESK

The EFILE Help Desk support units are located in each of the
Tax Centres.  Resource officers at the Help Desks are there to
provide electronic filers with technical support during testing and
throughout the production process.

Contact your EFILE Help Desk if you need assistance with:

     .    transmitting records to Revenue Canada
     .    acknowledgement file reports
     .    error messages
     .    return specifications

EFILE Help Desks are operational beginning November 1, 1995.  The
participating Tax Centres and their telephone numbers are
listed below.  Collect calls are accepted.

