SILENT HOUR SUPPORT
                      TELEPHONE NUMBER       TOLL FREE NUMBER
                      (613) 952-6173         same # (collect)

     The silent hours support service was established to assist
     efilers experiencing difficulties after normal business
     hours. Calls to this number should be restricted to those
     involving transmission related problems, acknowledgement
     files, system availability, etc. Questions related to error
     clues, refunds or similar matters, cannot be dealt with by
     the technicians providing this support service. Please
     contact your Help Desk for these types of questions.

Hours of Service (eastern standard (Ottawa) time)

Weekdays:  17:00 hrs. to 07:00 hrs. Monday to Friday
Weekends:  00:01 hrs. Saturdays to 07:00 hrs. Monday
           Excluding 15:00 hrs. to 23:00 hrs. Sunday

REVENUE CANADA HEADQUARTERS

ELECTRONIC FILING SECTION

The Electronic Filing Section is located in Ottawa at the Headquarters
of Revenue Canada.  Consultants at this office establish the policies
and procedures for EFILE as well as develop the enhancements and
expansion plans.  You may contact the Electronic Filing Section on
these matters by calling (613) 957-8113, collect,
or by writing to:

               Revenue Canada
               Individual Returns and Payments
                 Processing Directorate
               Electronic Filing Section
               400 Cumberland Street, Room 1052
               Ottawa, Ontario
               K1A-0L8


TAX SERVICES OFFICE EFILE COORDINATOR

EFILE Coordinators are located in each of the Tax Services Offices.
They provide public relations support and can help you with
non-technical policy and procedural queries.  Contact the
EFILE Coordinator in your area if you need help with:

     .    Promotional material and seminars
     .    forms and publications
     .    the EFILE application process
     .    information on enhancements and implementation dates

